; 0x32F ACC_AEB heartbeat, byte-verified against the vendor build's TX in
; route 00000037 (docs_site/op_byd_logs): static payload `05 80 02 0f ff ff`,
; 4-bit counter in byte 6 low nibble, 0xF constant in byte 6 high nibble,
; byd_checksum(0xAF) in byte 7. PAYLOAD is little-endian so the parse->pack
; echo round-trips byte-identical (48-bit Motorola start bit 0 does not).
BO_ 815 ACC_AEB: 8 XXX
 SG_ PAYLOAD : 0|48@1+ (1,0) [0|281474976710655] "" XXX
 SG_ Counter : 48|4@1+ (1,0) [0|15] "" XXX
