; --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Bus 1 0x10x raw-MRR block (Song Plus DM-i, ~25 Hz, src=1). Mined from
; docs_site/hour_logs + docs_site/byd_logs_2026-10-05_07; evidence chain and
; full numbers in docs/byd-radar-010x.md. The 415-segment re-scan refutes the
; old "status broadcast / counter artifact" verdict for 0x109 b7 (global
; distinct(b7)=240 vs HUD 4 bars; monotone mean(c4)>mean(c3)>mean(c2) strict
; in 90.3% of eligible segments; within-constant-bar hold variation median
; 9.99% vs 0.00% for no-lead) - it is a continuous forward target distance,
; upstream of the 0x32D gap bars, NOT a bar echo.
; STATUS: HYPOTHESIS entries only, NO on-car parser instantiates these frames
; (radar_interface.py / values.py / control paths untouched, CP.radarUnavailable
; unchanged - road behavior byte-identical). b0 CRC IS CRACKED (2026-10-18):
; SAE J1850 CRC-8 = CRC-8(poly 0x1D, init 0xFF, no refl, xorout 0xFF) over
; b1..b7 -> b0; 100% on 2933 unique payloads (hour_logs) and 80100/80100 on a
; different-day set (hour_logs_2, frames 101/102/106/109/10A).
; The LongDist_109 unit u: hard upper bound u <= 0.42-0.44 from 13 stop-to-lead
; events in byd_logs_2026-10-05_07 (tools/byd/radar_stop2lead.py; per-window
; u <= D/delta_b7 holds since the lead cannot reverse) -> METERS 1.0 AND
; 0.5/0.45 REFUTED. Surviving candidates were feet 0.3048 vs 0.25. PINNED
; 2026-10-19 by owner decision: u = 0.25 m/count (recalled real stop gap on the
; 0.25 side: 15c -> 3.75 m; tau ladder {0.71,1.02,1.4} s, minor-gap shapes).
; Derivatives: block-C x12 = 1/32 m, block-B = 1 dm, min b7=9 -> 2.25 m,
; b7=246 top -> 61.5 m. Offline logs cannot tighten this further; see CM_.
; All non-HYPOTHESIS bytes are MSG_<frame>_B<n> raw placeholders (factor 1,
; offset 0) - no fabricated field formulas. Bit order is Motorola @0+ with
; MSB start bits (byte k = 8k..8k+7), whole byte k = (8k+7)|8@0+.
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------------

; 0x101/0x105: pure transport retransmissions - 99.7-100% byte-identical to
; each other including b0, so they are NOT a checksum/redundancy source for
; 0x109. b7 there behaves RawLongDist-like (corr 0.73-0.77, ratio drift
; 1.36-2x, can see targets earlier than the HUD bar) - kept as placeholder.
BO_ 257 RADAR_RETX_101: 8 XXX
 SG_ MSG_10x_CheckSum : 7|8@0+ (1,0) [0|255] "" XXX
 SG_ MSG_10x_AliveCounter : 15|8@0+ (1,0) [0|255] "" XXX
 SG_ MSG_101_B2 : 23|8@0+ (1,0) [0|255] "" XXX
 SG_ MSG_101_B3 : 31|8@0+ (1,0) [0|255] "" XXX
 SG_ MSG_101_B4 : 39|8@0+ (1,0) [0|255] "" XXX
 SG_ MSG_101_B5 : 47|8@0+ (1,0) [0|255] "" XXX
 SG_ MSG_101_B6 : 55|8@0+ (1,0) [0|255] "" XXX
 SG_ MSG_101_B7 : 63|8@0+ (1,0) [0|255] "" XXX

